WEBVTT

00:43:28.103 --> 00:43:31.291
And somebody wrote back to her,
"I trust she had a peaceful death."

00:43:31.315 --> 00:43:35.107
And GiGi wrote back,
"I trust you never met Rayya Elias."

00:43:35.131 --> 00:43:37.131
(Laughs)

00:43:38.230 --> 00:43:40.159
And I laugh about it,

00:43:40.183 --> 00:43:43.389
because it was her,
and it's what I loved about her.

00:43:43.413 --> 00:43:44.858
You know?

00:43:44.882 --> 00:43:47.701
She just -- my personal definition
of the word "Rayya"

00:43:47.725 --> 00:43:51.163
is "that which you cannot see coming
and that which you cannot control."

00:43:51.187 --> 00:43:52.961
She was such a force of nature,

00:43:52.985 --> 00:43:56.483
and she wouldn't have had it
any other way.

00:43:56.507 --> 00:43:59.061
So it's not the death I want,

00:43:59.085 --> 00:44:01.473
it's not the death I would
want you to have,